 "transcript": [
  "[action] Wang Lung enjoys the earth's smell.",
  "[action] Elder son takes wife's hand",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and it is not for the sake of this or that that I do it, but because there is a good feeling in it.\"",
  "[action] Elder son gestures to land",
  "[action] Wang Lung rubs his face, enjoying the earth's smell.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and looks at his sons.",
  "[action] The second son pulls his feet up under him.",
  "[action] Wang Lung touches his eldest son's hand.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and now I have two of my sons married, and the first of them, too, who would have thought that I should have two sons married and the one of them already an officer!\"",
  "[says] (to the second son) Wang Lung expresses pride in his sons.",
  "[action] Wang Lung smokes his pipe",
  "[action] Wang Lung smokes his pipe and watches his sons.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung calls his sons",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung, the second son): \"Well, and we are not like any other men, we are not like the farmers who come out of the fields with the sweat on their faces and their clothes torn.\"",
  "[says] Eldest son responds with pride",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and you are my sons, and you may say what you will.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son discuss marriage",
  "[action] Wang Lung listens and smokes his pipe.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"We will have to get wives for them, too.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung calls his eldest son"
